From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anton Palgunov <toxblh@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 10:48:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 47/99] v8: e2k: select by a predicate: a compare and a merge

Select on a comparison branched over a move (two branches when the
result was neither value), select on a bit test and SelectWord masked
both values and joined them: five operations. A merge takes either value
by the predicate of the compare. New layer instructions seleq, sellt,
selltu, seltstz(i) and tstz(i)/tstnz(i) for the test as a value;
MacroAssembler::SelectCmp, SelectTst, CompareTst; SelectWord is one
compare and one merge.
